E1B8                             ; (stored, not echoed), every other key is stored and echoed until the line
E1B8                             ; is full. B = the length so far; the low byte of the top cell becomes the
E1B8                             ; most allowed (it holds minus the count on entry).
E1B8   8C FF 81     LINE:     CMPX   #-127   ; (X = TOS, minus the count)
E1BB   24 04                  BHS   ln1   
E1BD   86 81                  LDA   #-127   ; more than 127 is taken as 127
E1BF   A7 41                  STA   1,U   
